<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
How does this config work:
- Every <Effect> line is one visual effect for zombie special powers (SpecialAttribute.xml).
- animType = 0 particle, 1 animation, 2 animator, 3 mixed. playTime = seconds (-1 = until stopped).

How to add a brand new effect into this config:
  - This needs code. The index must be a value in SpecialAttribute.SpecialAttributeEffectType.
  1. Add the new value to SpecialAttributeEffectType in the code.
  2. Copy the last <Effect ... /> line, paste it at the end, and set index to that value.
  3. Set fileName to the effect prefab.
-->
